  "card": "Centralizes default sanitizer options and suppression paths into a generated with_sanitizer_env.py script, de-duplicating settings across CI scripts, test runners, and developer documentation. The defaults are automatically applied in functional tests and fuzz runs, while allowing explicit environment variables to take precedence. It also enables ThreadSanitizer adaptive delay (enable_adaptive_delay=1) by default to help detect rare race conditions.",
